---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy — Devin Alexander" description="How your data is handled on devin.vc." noIndex>
  <main>
    <section class="legal-page">
      <div class="legal-inner">
        <header class="page-header">
          <div class="section-tag"><span class="tag-number">i</span><span class="tag-dash" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="tag-label">Legal</span></div>
          <h1 class="page-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
          <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated March 5, 2026</p>
          <div class="title-rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </header>

        <article class="legal-body">
          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Overview</h2>
            <p>This site (<strong>devin.vc</strong>) is a personal portfolio and consulting site operated by Devin Alexander. Your privacy matters. This policy explains what data is collected, why, and how it's handled.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Information collected</h2>

            <h3>Contact form</h3>
            <p>When you submit the contact form, the following information is collected: your name, email address, and message. This data is used solely to respond to your inquiry and is stored in a private database.</p>

            <h3>Booking form</h3>
            <p>When you book a call, the following information is collected: your name, email address, phone number (optional), preferred time slot, timezone, and any notes you provide. This data is shared with Cal.com to schedule the meeting and is stored in a private database for record-keeping.</p>

            <h3>Newsletter</h3>
            <p>If you subscribe to the newsletter, your email address and first name are collected. Subscription is double opt-in: you must confirm via email before receiving any content. You can unsubscribe at any time via the link in every email. Subscriber data is managed through Resend.</p>

            <h3>Analytics</h3>
            <p>With your consent, this site uses Vercel Analytics and Vercel Speed Insights to understand how visitors engage with the site. These tools collect anonymous, aggregated data such as page views, referrers, and performance metrics. No personal information is tracked, and no advertising profiles are built.</p>

            <h3>Cookies</h3>
            <p>This site uses a cookie consent mechanism. Analytics cookies are only set if you explicitly accept them. A <code>cookie-consent</code> preference is stored in your browser's localStorage. No third-party tracking cookies are used.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>How your data is used</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>To respond to your contact form submissions</li>
              <li>To schedule and confirm booked calls</li>
              <li>To send newsletter content you opted into</li>
              <li>To understand aggregate site usage (with your consent)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Your data is never sold, rented, or shared with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Third-party services</h2>
            <p>This site relies on the following third-party services to operate:</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Vercel</strong> — hosting, analytics, and speed insights</li>
              <li><strong>Resend</strong> — transactional and newsletter emails</li>
              <li><strong>Cal.com</strong> — call scheduling</li>
              <li><strong>Turso</strong> — database hosting</li>
              <li><strong>Clerk</strong> — dashboard authentication (admin only)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>Each service has its own privacy policy governing data it processes.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Data retention</h2>
            <p>Contact and booking records are retained indefinitely for business correspondence purposes. Newsletter subscriber data is retained until you unsubscribe, at which point your record is marked as unsubscribed. You may request deletion of your data at any time by emailing <a href="mailto:me@devin.vc">me@devin.vc</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Your rights</h2>
            <p>You have the right to:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Access the personal data held about you</li>
              <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
              <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
              <li>Withdraw consent for analytics cookies at any time (clear your browser's localStorage)</li>
              <li>Unsubscribe from the newsletter at any time</li>
            </ul>
            <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact <a href="mailto:me@devin.vc">me@devin.vc</a>.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
            <p>This policy may be updated from time to time. Material changes will be noted by updating the date at the top of this page.</p>
          </section>

          <section class="legal-section">
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about this privacy policy can be directed to <a href="mailto:me@devin.vc">me@devin.vc</a>.</p>
          </section>
        </article>

        <div class="page-footer">
          <a href="/" class="back-link">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M13 7H1M6 2L1 7l5 5" />
            </svg>
            Back home
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    min-height: 100dvh;
    padding: var(--space-page-top) var(--space-page-x) var(--space-page-bottom);
    background: var(--color-bg);
  }

  .legal-inner {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ---- Section tag ---- */
  .section-tag {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
  }

  .tag-number {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .tag-dash {
    width: 24px;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-accent), transparent);
  }

  .tag-label {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--text-xs);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  /* ---- Header ---- */
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-block-lg);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .title-rule {
    width: 48px;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--color-accent), color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 30%, transparent));
    margin-top: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  /* ---- Body ---- */
  .legal-body {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-family: 'Instrument Serif', serif;
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-section h3 {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-section p {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  .legal-section li::marker {
    color: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 50%, transparent);
  }

  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-accent) 30%, transparent);
    transition: border-color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .legal-section a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .legal-section strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: var(--weight-medium);
  }

  .legal-section code {
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 0.82em;
    background: color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-text-muted) 8%, transparent);
    padding: 0.15em 0.4em;
    border-radius: 3px;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  /* ---- Footer ---- */
  .page-footer {
    margin-top: var(--space-block);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--color-text-muted) 15%, transparent);
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .back-link svg {
    transition: transform 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .back-link:hover svg {
    transform: translateX(-3px);
  }
</style>
